                                 case and select stament

1. case statment:
 --> the case statment is used when we want to choose one option from multiple possiblities.
 syntax:

 case <$variable> in
      pattern-1)
              commmands
              ;;
      pattern-2)
               commands
               ;;
      pattern-3)
              commmands
              ;;
      *)
         deafult commands
         ;;
 esac

 here,
 case : start of statemnt
 $variable : value we want to check
 pattern-1/pattern-2 : are matching patterns
 ) : ends the pattern
 ;; : ends the option
 * : default option
 esac : ends the case statment(case written backwords)


 2. select statment:
 --> select statment is used to creat a simple menu automatically in bash.
 --> with select bash automatically displays the options with numbers.

 syntax:

 select  variable in option1 option2 option3
 do
        commands
done